# Wave W17-Z (Route 215): puddle pine — a wet pine in dark saturated greens, tiered and rain-heavy, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on puddle turf (ground baked in). Route 215’s own tree — split from Route 214’s fresh verge pine by saturation entire (rain-dark vs meadow-fresh) and from Farewell Spring’s spring pine by weight: this crown carries rain, that one carries light.
